@startuml
!theme plain
!pragma layout smetana
title SSHTransport connection lifecycle (TASK-260715-2ny6z4)

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Resolving : connect / validate injected policy
Resolving --> TCPConnecting : endpoint resolved
TCPConnecting --> KeyExchange : socket connected
KeyExchange --> AwaitingHostDecision : raw host key available
AwaitingHostDecision --> Authenticating : policy accepts
AwaitingHostDecision --> Failed : unknown / changed / rejected
Authenticating --> Ready : public-key auth succeeds
Authenticating --> Failed : rejected / unavailable / timeout
Ready --> Rekeying : byte / time / explicit / server trigger
Rekeying --> Ready : KEX succeeds / generation + 1
Rekeying --> Failed : KEX timeout or failure

Ready --> Closing : close
Failed --> Closing : fail pending work once
Closing --> Closed : channels, session, socket released
Closed --> [*]

note right of AwaitingHostDecision
  Credential lookup and user authentication
  are forbidden before host acceptance.
end note

note right of Rekeying
  Existing channels stay logically valid.
  New opens wait with bounded deadlines.
end note

note right of Closing
  Idempotent, ownership reaches zero;
  caller cancellation cannot interrupt cleanup.
end note

note left of Closing
  cancel or close from any nonterminal
  state enters Closing exactly once.
end note
@enduml
